      "html": "<p>Formerly the pike cichlids were split into two genera: Batrachops and Crenicichla. Batrachops were the rather blunt-headed species. Nowadays this classification is no longer accepted and Batrachops is seen only as a synonym of Crenicichla. However, hobbyists have not forgotten the old name.</p>"
